READING
  The fine lambda sweep found the Sharpe surface jagged in lambda
  (0.30 / 0.25 / 0.22 / 0.29 across steps of 1e-4). A null here
  means the 0.38-vs-0.25 gap is not separable from that roughness,
  which is a statement about the SURFACE, not about lambda.
